      "activity_description": "Modify the dependency management section to use the specified versions for all listed dependencies.",
      "most_likely_effort": 4
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A5.2",
      "activity_name": "Resolve dependency conflicts and transitive updates",
      "activity_description": "Analyze and resolve any version conflicts arising from the upgrade; update transitive dependencies as needed.",
